  "comment": "Ep51 Bosnia & Herzegovina vs Qatar (Group B, Matchday 2). SPINE 'The Dragon's Last Fire' — Edin Dzeko, 40, the Bosnian Diamond, a fire that flares one last time; a nation reborn from war, against Qatar's Al-Annabi (the Maroon) erasing their 2022 humiliation. MATCH UNPLAYED -> OUR PREDICTION Bosnia 1-0 Qatar. ONE goal only: Dzeko 44' header from a Pjanic free kick (his 66th international goal); 0-0 until 44'. Qatar press (Afif, Almoez Ali force a Vasilj save) but Bosnia holds; at 87' Dzeko defends in his own box. vol=0 on every clip (silent reused/AI clips; audio = VO + music + sfx). Atmosphere library: bih-fans, qat-fans, stadium, celebration, mystery-bridge (Mostar's Stari Most) + 10 player clips, reused via distinct ids. Scenes reference these ids via <ClipSprite id=...>. Legend 051 = The Bridge Keeper (Mostar's Stari Most — destroyed in war, rebuilt — the soul of a nation reborn). Brian VO.",
